    ("좋은 노트북 추천해주세요", "semantic_search", "Korean: recommend a good laptop", "mentions laptop products or friendly response"),
    ("我想要一台新电脑", "semantic_search", "Chinese: I want a new computer", "mentions computer products or friendly response"),
